Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,cut through the wind and make A stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,don't let the darkness\Nwin, just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone,\Nwe'll go where we all want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay focused!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish you this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.33,0:02:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just break Master\NQueen's sword with his neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I saw, but that\Nwould be impossible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Sanji's neck broke\Nthat sword in twain! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of power has he got?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You did that yourself\Nwithout armament, Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.16,0:02:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I get to see\Nsome germatech after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's happening again. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.78,0:03:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Never seen someone with\Na body like yours before,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but I do remember Judge going on about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give humans exoskeletons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And accelerated healing, he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give them incredible strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.26,0:03:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And a heart of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be swayed by petty emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I deeply apologize, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I never should have offered\Na dish so appalling to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to leave\Na scar on a lady's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a human, not a cold-blooded\Ncreature like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't gotta cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Monster Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.98,0:04:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You are gonna fit right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.64,0:04:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Coffee Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a sec here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta figure out what's\Ngoing on with my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a little time to think, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have caused this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You really like wasting\Nmy time, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it because I transformed\Ninto Silver Mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I used the suit a couple of times\Nand I'm losing my humanity already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:04:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.04,0:05:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.22,0:05:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he's scared of Master Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's talking to himself or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.38,0:05:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's asking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for., Blackleg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to eat lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a bullseye. Nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His exoskeleton's top!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me more of your germ attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Put on the suit, be a pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up about germa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I got nothing to do with those maniacs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're probably a spy\Nfor the Navy, but who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sweating the deets right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters to me is whether\Nyou want to take down Kaido or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When this fight's over, the loser will be\Ndead and the winner will be busted up bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect chance to send them\Non their way, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You dig it. There's room for one more. We\Ncan just snatch up the spoils and bounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we're not loyal to kaido's army and we got
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing riding on those\Nsamurai either so there's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,no reason for us to\Nfight how audacious you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,really think i trust a\Nrotten backstabber like
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you no offense but you're\Nnot too trustworthy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself pal but we can\Nboth trust each other
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,to act in our self-interest\Nif you want to hit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it big this is the best\Nchance you'll ever have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you laughing at don't tell\Nme you've lost your mind i know i've
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,cornered you but try to die with some
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dignity. Did you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,a smile fruit perhaps
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,what a picturesque tragedy brilliant\Nlook guys over there are you okay killer
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, kids, I can't believe\Nyou sold out to Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for betraying us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lay a finger on him, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I forbid it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our enemy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't we help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed, I've taken\Nyour captain's life hostage. From what I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,gather he's fighting against Big Mom right\Nnow already a losing battle one might say
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have two options, and I'll\Ngladly make the decision for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We better think of something fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to bail if\Nthe fire gets any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we brought Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We better hurry, that\Nfire's spreading fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.86,0:09:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, a human legman monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Patty, someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down so I can catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, slow down, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You grab the leg of Kitemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want my help or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's not a ghost after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it human?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps a dream? Leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm searching for my allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your ally, Kitemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, your old pal, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hand me, you rogue,\Nfor there is no time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.48,0:10:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't hear us without ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.98,0:10:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know where his head's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how do we let him know that it's us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove your hands from my posterior.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he talking to us without a mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Farts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's call it a special talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What fox he can't hear us. I must
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Train and he can't see. Oh, I got it here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The reverse crescent moon you\Ntrace that on my posterior
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that means you're an Ally\Nyeah how is easy please lend
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, your assistance. One of\Nmy companions is in a terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,state right now I'm begging\Nyou please come to her aid
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We can have Hamlet take us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,there see you later Tama
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,goodness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so terribly popular today.\NHead to the left tower on the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Castle's first floor. My ally is\Nin a crawl space. There I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,not who you are but you have\Nmy thanks okay legs count on me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt like hell\Nwhat's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a migraine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What terrible timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.98,0:12:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too bad. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, Hera. Yes? Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Napoleon. Ready, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.10,0:12:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A kiss won't fix it, but your head won't\Nhurt after I chop it off. Come on! Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how about a thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die protecting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop getting in my way, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, shamble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And counter-shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you do that to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stolen fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, Mama, Mama, Mama Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of you naughty\Nboys should I chop up first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The quack who keeps getting in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.98,0:13:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the half-dead, loud-mouthed rascal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made it to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going head-to-head with an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If I end up dying here,\Nthen what was it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure know how to make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you gotta get back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to kill you, but it\Nseems like you're dying just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I think not. Sorry. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is someone doing this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.48,0:14:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.80,0:15:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go, and you can\Nhave my life instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You value Kid far too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're better off without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You have suffered tremendously,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but all those misfortunes can\Nbe traced back to your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, do you, Hawkins?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid will surpass the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeating the four emperors?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Becoming king of the pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What grand ambitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How admirable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you getting in our way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In your way, am I then? Pick\Nup your blades and kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,i would accept your surrender you know i'd
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,even put in a good word\Nfor you with kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.22,0:16:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you're asking me to serve\Nthat bastard after all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry i'm not as pathetic as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,imbecile your battle was doomed from\Nthe start you have no hope of beating an
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,emperor you've seen the beast you're up\Nagainst surely you understand now why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.82,0:16:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,they've ruled the seas for so\Nlong your instincts must be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,telling you to run for your\Nlife any opposition is futile!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,don't need to yell about it you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,hide your regret you took the coward's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, if you bow to me, I\Nshall welcome you as my subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I get to bow
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,in quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You sacrificed your dignity to save your\Nlife, but we never surrendered and we're
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This tale has not ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see which one of\Nus regrets our choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Then sink or swim. I'll finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,this with no regrets\Nyou'll get what's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't last like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nighty-night, you, Erica.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.30,0:18:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have two questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen if you take damage\Nsomewhere that has no conduit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does that affect?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made the nature of my\Npower perfectly clear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Any damage I take goes straight to Kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,His straw doll exists inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.86,0:18:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Every inch of his body acts as\Nmy personal shield. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:18:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you sever my arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The damage should have gone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid, he's missing an arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.98,0:19:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't prepared for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The second question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I take this doll, how many\Nlives are left to protect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.72,0:19:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw man cards. They're\Nupright. The card of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Beheading Claws!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.88,0:20:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.66,0:20:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The straw man isn't dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It will return if the cards so decree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall reveal the true\Nending of this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.30,0:20:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Spin and Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.72,0:21:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.56,0:21:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Man Card, The Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It has two meanings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.44,0:21:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,One, the collapse of the old
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:22:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see what I can do\Nabout that. Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny, I feel light as a feather!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.18,0:22:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the card's hidden\Nmeaning, a new path forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.52,0:22:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go get her, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku, they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.64,0:22:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How fortunate that I found an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.96,0:22:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How fortunate that I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.10,0:22:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after being chopped in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps my body was not\Nreattached properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.26,0:23:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,After Sir Law cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.96,0:23:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It is truly a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I pray that my fortune holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.06,0:23:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So that Kiku may be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.22,0:23:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.13,0:23:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this on? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.30,0:23:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.32,0:23:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.23,0:23:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Orochi's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.14,0:23:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain that I thoroughly\Nbeheaded him in our last encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.84,0:23:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he does not know\Nthat Kanjuro has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.40,0:23:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can't you roll?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Lord Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.18,0:23:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You barely breathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.38,0:23:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed I fear this is the\Nend of my performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.94,0:24:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, rejoice!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.98,0:24:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done well!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.32,0:24:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You played your part to perfection!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.64,0:24:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall carry your kind\Nwords to the next world!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.94,0:24:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, Contero!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.92,0:24:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Leeson, the crowd cheers for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and you hear them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're cheering for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.32,0:24:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But my resentment has not faded!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.32,0:24:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.32,0:24:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.24,0:24:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ancestors!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.32,0:25:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're waiting for a spectacular encore!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.90,0:25:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, raise your brush and paint it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.38,0:25:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the Kurozumi clan's burning crutch!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.24,0:25:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not defeated yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.38,0:25:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The wrath of the Kurozumi\Nclan will come to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.62,0:25:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It will parade from this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.24,0:25:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.22,0:25:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Walking deep into the abyss\Nuntil its fury is spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the place where it finds\Nrest at last will be our premium.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.68,0:25:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you can put our tired\Nspirits to rest, Kanjuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.82,0:25:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.56,0:25:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my most esteemed audience,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.06,0:26:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I present to you my final\Nperformance, the Kurozumi clan
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.54,0:26:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Suicide, rapid finale, Kazenbo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.66,0:26:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.78,0:26:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned into a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.32,0:26:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a report!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.06,0:26:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Some sort of giant apparition has appeared
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.30,0:26:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,on the second floor\Ninside the castle halls!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.26,0:26:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.72,0:27:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but it passes through walls like\Na ghost that seems to spread fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle is now engulfed in flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.24,0:27:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me, give me, give me\Nthat germ-a-suit, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.22,0:27:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me germ-a-suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.44,0:27:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.90,0:27:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shut you up for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.18,0:27:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,there's
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.96,0:27:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,far
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.87,0:27:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,too much fire it's time to pull back we
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.36,0:28:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,can't stay here and fight I agree the\Nfire will cut off our retreat if we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.76,0:28:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.76,0:28:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Klemn and its allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.04,0:28:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Emperor of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.02,0:28:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you should know that\Npride comes before the fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.32,0:29:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.52,0:29:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, ahhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.86,0:29:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.30,0:29:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.50,0:29:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Redheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.54,0:29:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,H - H - H - H - H -
